    "gameplay.modesIndex": "// MODES",
    "gameplay.modesTitle": "Game Modes",
    "gameplay.roundTitle": "From Buy Phase to Clutch",
    "gameplay.roundP1": "Each round begins in the buy phase as squads assess economy, select firearms, and optimize utility loadouts for the map. Teams then execute aggressive takes or stubborn holds, adjusting rotations based on enemy tells, territory control, and Spike placement. The instant a site is breached or denied, momentum shifts: split-second decisions at map choke points decide between surgical victory and chaotic defeat.",
    "gameplay.roundP2": "Once the Spike is planted, focus narrows to timing, pressure, and clear communication. Disciplined defenders bide their moments while attackers force duels at critical angles. In the dying seconds, with lone survivors remaining, action ascends into the clutch: one duel, one read, and one bullet decides the round.",
    "gameplay.keyFeaturesTitle": "Key Mechanics",
    "gameplay.keyFeat1": "Dynamic round economy system shaping buy decisions and weapon tier choices.",
    "gameplay.keyFeat2": "High-impact ability combos enabling coordinated site executes and denials.",
    "gameplay.keyFeat3": "Spike carrier mechanics demanding strategic team protection and positioning.",
    "gameplay.keyFeat4": "Destructible environment doors and teleporters creating unpredictable rotations.",

