    "map.desc.pearl": "Two-site underwater battleground featuring rapid rotations and open duels. Attackers pressure mid or flanks, while defenders maintain strict lane control.",
    "map.desc.ascent": "An open playground for small territory wars divided across Ascent's courtyard. Sites feature irreversible reinforced blast doors that alter round flow.",
    "map.desc.icebox": "An arctic excavation complex shrouded in ice. Features complex verticality, hanging ziplines, and industrial steel containers.",
    "map.desc.bind": "Two distinct sites connected by one-way sound-emitting teleporters, demanding decisive rotations and spatial utility coordination.",
    "map.desc.haven": "Unique three-site battleground offering abundant angular avenues for tactical lane defense and disciplined counter-rotations.",
    "map.desc.split": "Vertical combat zones, elevated sniper perches, and high-ground sewer routes requiring mastery over both major side lanes.",
    "map.desc.lotus": "Mystical ruin featuring three sites, rotating stone doorways, a destructible wall, and fluid multi-level territory battles.",
    "map.desc.fracture": "Top-secret research facility split into dual attacker spawn points, surrounding defenders and demanding proactive territory containment.",
    "map.desc.abyss": "Complex cavernous underground facility with open-void drop-offs, testing precision movement and vertical positioning.",
    "map.desc.summit": "Advanced Radiant academy in China with massive destructible fortress walls that permanently redraw the battlefield layout.",
