    "about.stackAstroDesc": "Generates high-speed static pages via Islands architecture. Zero unnecessary browser JavaScript for instant page loads.",
    "about.stackTsDesc": "Strongly-typed static data structures for the 29-Agent database, abilities, maps, news articles, and dual-language (i18n) translation module.",
